://github.com/DuQiuMaple","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuQiuMaple/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuQiuMaple/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuQiuMaple/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuQiuMaple/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuQiuMaple/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuQiuMaple/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuQiuMaple/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuQiuMaple/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DuQiuMaple/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T07:09:14Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T07:09:14Z","body":"My project has a similar bug.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600517086/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3813918035","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104724#issuecomment-3813918035","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104724","id":3813918035,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jU8VT","user":{"login":"bmorledge-hampton19","id":22180776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTgwNzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22180776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmorledge-hampton19","html_url":"https://github.com/bmorledge-hampton19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmorledge-hampton19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmorledge-hampton19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmorledge-hampton19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmorledge-hampton19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmorledge-hampton19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmorledge-hampton19/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmorledge-hampton19/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmorledge-hampton19/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmorledge-hampton19/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T21:02:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T21:21:38Z","body":"I just happened across this bug as well. It was very annoying to track down since the behavior is somewhat inconsistent and does seemed to be related to the speed of the mouse when it moves into the overlapping control node.\n\nI think it's worth noting that the Area2D _is_ emitting the mouse_exited signal when the mouse moves into the overlapping control, which seems like intended behavior. The problem starts when the mouse_entered event is re-emitted immediately after the mouse_exited event. Additionally, after this happens, the Area2D seems to be tethered to the control node and won't emit area_exited again until the mouse exits **both** the control and the Area2D, even if the control doesn't fully overlap the Area2D (and even if the Area2D moves and is no longer overlapping the control at all!) Very strange...\n\nI would love to see this fixed. I'm working on a project where I have Control-based UI elements overlaid on background elements using collision polygons as click masks. This bug has been causing unintentional \"click through\" events that have been cumbersome to work around.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3813918035/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3947950301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104724#issuecomment-3947950301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104724","id":3947950301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rUPDd","user":{"login":"Tmurdoch","id":55200688,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjAwNjg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55200688?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tmurdoch","html_url":"https://github.com/Tmurdoch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tmurdoch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tmurdoch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tmurdoch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tmurdoch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tmurdoch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tmurdoch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tmurdoch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tmurdoch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tmurdoch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-23T23:37:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T23:41:27Z","body":"I have a similar problem, but in my case my node is not firing mouse_entered at all when spawned from a control node with Mouse filter PASS on all of them. Here is an MRP: \n\n[test_node_2026-02-23_17-41-14.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25502850/test_node_2026-02-23_17-41-14.zip)\n\nI am on godot version 4.6.1 -stable","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3947950301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]